    },
    {
      "start": 690.18,
      "end": 692.66,
      "text": "is it will accept the DEIS."
    },
    {
      "start": 692.66,
      "end": 695.16,
      "text": "We will post it, as I said, post it on the website"
    },
    {
      "start": 695.16,
      "end": 697.52,
      "text": "and make it available for public review,"
    },
    {
      "start": 697.52,
      "end": 700.0,
      "text": "distribute it to involved agencies."
    },
    {
      "start": 700.0,
      "end": 703.42,
      "text": "It does not essentially move the needle on the application."
    },
    {
      "start": 703.42,
      "end": 705.06,
      "text": "We're not to the point where we're making"
    },
    {
      "start": 705.06,
      "end": 708.42,
      "text": "any kind of finding statement, making any approvals."
    },
    {
      "start": 708.42,
      "end": 712.2,
      "text": "What's going to happen is that when the moratorium"
    },
    {
      "start": 712.2,
      "end": 713.94,
      "text": "is filed with the Secretary of State"
    },
    {
      "start": 713.94,
      "end": 715.88,
      "text": "and that moratorium goes into effect,"
    },
    {
      "start": 715.88,
      "end": 718.28,
      "text": "we will cease review of this application."
    },
    {
      "start": 718.28,
      "end": 721.82,
      "text": "I do see it as sort of a positive in that"
    },
    {
      "start": 721.82,
      "end": 725.86,
      "text": "getting this DEIS into the hands of involved agencies,"
    },
    {
      "start": 725.86,
      "end": 728.06,
      "text": "to be frank, the New York State Department of Transportation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 728.06,
      "end": 730.9,
      "text": "they don't care about our local moratorium."
    },
    {
      "start": 730.9,
      "end": 732.52,
      "text": "They're not going to be reviewing this"
    },
    {
      "start": 732.52,
      "end": 733.8,
      "text": "and commenting on it tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "start": 733.8,
      "end": 736.06,
      "text": "So the longer it's in the hands of involved agencies,"
    },
    {
      "start": 736.06,
      "end": 738.9,
      "text": "we'll actually give them more time to review it,"
    },
    {
      "start": 738.9,
      "end": 740.56,
      "text": "provide comments back to it,"
    },
    {
      "start": 740.56,
      "end": 744.5,
      "text": "at such time that the moratorium would be lifted."
    },
    {
      "start": 744.5,
      "end": 746.2,
      "text": "We could then begin review."
    },
    {
      "start": 746.2,
      "end": 747.44,
      "text": "And obviously after that,"
    },
    {
      "start": 747.44,
      "end": 748.28,
      "text": "the next steps would be to review it"
    },
    {
      "start": 748.28,
      "end": 749.92,
      "text": "and we'll be scheduling public hearings"
    },
    {
      "start": 749.92,
      "end": 752.86,
      "text": "on the DEIS subdivision and moving forward."
    },
    {
      "start": 752.86,
      "end": 754.82,
      "text": "But just so for the Board's knowledge,"
    },
    {
      "start": 754.82,
      "end": 758.22,
      "text": "this resolution will just accept the DEIS"
    },
    {
      "start": 758.22,
      "end": 760.4,
      "text": "and authorized distribution."
    },
    {
      "start": 760.4,
      "end": 761.96,
      "text": "We will have the Planning Department"
    },
    {
      "start": 761.96,
      "end": 763.56,
      "text": "and Sam Schwartz will provide a list"
    },
    {
      "start": 763.56,
      "end": 766.46,
      "text": "of substantive comments on the document"
    },
    {
      "start": 767.66,
      "end": 769.0,
      "text": "once the moratorium is lifted"
    },
    {
      "start": 769.0,
      "end": 770.64,
      "text": "and we get to public hearings,"
    },
    {
      "start": 770.64,
      "end": 772.04,
      "text": "and we'll go from there."
    },
    {
      "start": 772.04,
      "end": 773.9,
      "text": "So this is just a procedural step"
    },
    {
      "start": 774.9,
      "end": 777.44,
      "text": "because we are on timelines under SECRA"
    },
    {
      "start": 777.44,
      "end": 779.78,
      "text": "for the review of the revised DEIS."
    },
    {
      "start": 779.78,
      "end": 781.14,
      "text": "I understand the timeline."
    },
    {
      "start": 781.14,
      "end": 783.38,
      "text": "I just want to make it clear to everybody out there"
    },
    {
      "start": 783.38,
      "end": 787.42,
      "text": "that once the state does file the moratorium,"
    },
    {
      "start": 787.42,
      "end": 790.86,
      "text": "there will be no in-house activity on it."
    },
    {
      "start": 790.86,
      "end": 793.86,
      "text": "Outside agencies may still conduct business,"
    },
    {
      "start": 793.86,
      "end": 795.42,
      "text": "but not in the town."
    },
    {
      "start": 795.42,
      "end": 796.2,
      "text": "Is that clear?"
    },
    {
      "start": 796.2,
      "end": 797.0,
      "text": "That's correct."
    },
    {
      "start": 797.0,
      "end": 797.82,
      "text": "Thank you, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": 801.9,
      "end": 804.5,
      "text": "Any other questions from any Board members?"
    },
    {
      "start": 804.5,
      "end": 806.6,
      "text": "There is a resolution on tonight."
    },
    {
      "start": 806.6,
      "end": 807.44,
      "text": "Yes, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": 807.44,
      "end": 812.32,
      "text": "And that resolution just accepts the DEIS,"
    },
    {
      "start": 812.32,
      "end": 814.72,
      "text": "authorizes circulation to involved agencies,"
    },
    {
      "start": 814.72,
      "end": 817.22,
      "text": "and makes the document available for public review."
    },
    {
      "start": 818.08,
      "end": 818.92,
      "text": "Great."
    },
    {
      "start": 820.46,
      "end": 821.28,
      "text": "Everybody good?"
    },
    {
      "start": 821.28,
      "end": 822.12,
      "text": "Yep."
    },
    {
      "start": 823.38,
      "end": 824.52,
      "text": "All right, at this time,"
    },
    {
      "start": 824.52,
      "end": 827.5,
      "text": "we'd like to ask for public comments on any resolution."
    },
    {
      "start": 830.9,
      "end": 832.76,
      "text": "Don't all come up at once."
    },
    {
      "start": 832.76,
      "end": 837.44,
      "text": "All right, I'll move resolution 2024-001 for Delalio,"
    },
    {
      "start": 837.44,
      "end": 842.44,
      "text": "and I'll move resolution 2024-002 for the City of Sard Farm,"
    },
    {
      "start": 842.44,
      "end": 845.42,
      "text": "classifying the action pursuant to SECRA,"
    },
    {
      "start": 845.42,
      "end": 848.22,
      "text": "taking lead agency and issuing a negative deck."
    },
    {
      "start": 848.22,
      "end": 849.06,
      "text": "So moved."
    },
    {
      "start": 849.06,
      "end": 849.88,
      "text": "Second."
    },
    {
      "start": 851.46,
      "end": 852.86,
      "text": "Members Zelnicki?"
    },
    {
      "start": 852.86,
      "end": 853.68,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "start": 854.82,
      "end": 856.46,
      "text": "Member Hogan?"
    },
    {
      "start": 856.46,
      "end": 857.3,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "start": 858.16,
      "end": 859.46,
      "text": "Member De Niro?"
    },
    {
      "start": 859.46,
      "end": 860.3,
      "text": "Aye."
    },
    {
      "start": 860.3,
      "end": 861.14,
      "text": "Member Behr?"
    },
    {
      "start": 861.14,
      "end": 861.96,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "start": 861.96,
      "end": 862.8,
      "text": "And I vote yes."
    },
    {
      "start": 862.8,
      "end": 864.46,
      "text": "The resolution is adopted."
    },
    {
      "start": 864.46,
      "end": 865.3,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 865.3,
      "end": 867.44,
      "text": "I'll move resolution number 202-0202."
    },
    {
